# Every text file is checked out with LF line endings, on Windows too.
# deploy.sh and scripts/*.sh are shell scripts (a CR breaks them in WSL or
# Git Bash), and docs/images/logo.svg is compared byte for byte with what
# utils/logo.js renders. Git still detects binaries on its own; the lines
# below only make it explicit for the files that must never be touched.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
